## turn-180.soar -- thor-soar: 1 proposal.

## Propose turn-180.
sp {scan-room*propose*turn-180
    :default
   (state <s> ^name scan-room
              ^scan-record.scanned-180 false)
-->
   (<s> ^operator <op> + =)
   (<op> ^name turn-180
         ^task-operator true
         ^action-handle turn
         ^argument-count 2
         ^argument1 right
         ^argument2 90.0
         ^pre-conditions-satisfied true)
}
